{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Nodosis</strong> is a game of<strong> Tic-Tac-Toe, </strong>where the only goal is to<strong> beat the score. Deckbuild</strong> and<strong> Create </strong>the<strong> ultimate machine, </strong>by generating<strong> X, Y </strong>or just raw<strong> Pointage</strong> though either<strong> powerful </strong>(secret)<strong>\u00a03-In-A-Row Combinations, Buffed </strong>and<strong> Synergized</strong> tiles or through the many<strong> rare </strong>and<strong> powerful Rings</strong> in the game, provided you can afford them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874580/extras/ed77501568f41c689ec5270adb0100ef.poster.avif?t=1762801439\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874580/extras/ed77501568f41c689ec5270adb0100ef.webm?t=1762801439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874580/extras/ed77501568f41c689ec5270adb0100ef.mp4?t=1762801439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-</strong> <strong>Replay\u00a0</strong>Tic-Tac-Toe over and over again... By <strong>traversing</strong> through a linear map <strong>scattered</strong> with <strong>tradeoffs</strong> and <strong>advantages</strong>. Every so often, you'll be personally <strong>challenged</strong>  by an Oculus Eye... A <strong>Boss</strong> of sorts. Each boss has their own unique <strong>gimmick</strong> and <strong>requirements</strong>, with even the game board itself <strong>changing</strong> shape into a <strong>4-4 grid</strong>?!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- GAME -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Different Tile Types!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple different Tile Variants!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles and Bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And Large Numbers!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- INFO -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is still in development! I hope to release a <strong>Playable Demo</strong>\u00a0sometime this <strong>August</strong>!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- EXTRA INFO -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Itch.io Pre-Steam Demo is available! </strong>I'd like some feedback for improvement.<br><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Demo</strong> may arrive next November! <strong><i>Wishlist to stay Informed!</i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3874580?t=1762801439","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874580/64d97babf5689ed4090e885fb5781bd62b025e17/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762801439","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874580/03372b17fbddabdf55ddca15ce33a86c1f5fa33c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762801439","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874580/03372b17fbddabdf55ddca15ce33a86c1f5fa33c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762801439","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Nodosis</strong> is a game of<strong> Tic-Tac-Toe, </strong>where the only goal is to<strong> beat the score. Deckbuild</strong> and<strong> Create </strong>the<strong> ultimate machine, </strong>by generating<strong> X, Y </strong>or just raw<strong> Pointage</strong> though either<strong> powerful </strong>(secret)<strong>\u00a03-In-A-Row Combinations, Buffed </strong>and<strong> Synergized</strong> tiles or through the many<strong> rare </strong>and<strong> powerful Rings</strong> in the game, provided you can afford them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video clas